<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse closes slightly lower.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse closes slightly lower.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange closed 0.20 percent lower on Tuesday in quiet trading, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 611.66 compared to 612.66 on Monday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 426,000 dinars against 456,000 dinars.</p>
</text>
